[0.000, "o", " running chaitin-cli commands to manage Chaitin security products: SafeLine WAF (site management, IP blocking, ACL, policy rules, attack logs), DDR data security operations (devices, file scan tasks, approvals, policy\u001b[39m\r\n                          \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mlogs), X-Ray vulnerability scanner (scan tasks, results, assets), CloudWalker CWPP (events, vulnerabilities, assets), VeinMind container security (agents, image/container/Kubernetes assets, baseline, websites, web frameworks,\u001b[39m\r\n                          \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mruntime risks), and T-Answer (firewall rules, blocklists). (user)\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m/security-review\u001b[39m        \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mComplete a security review of the pending changes on the current branch\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m/clear\u001b[39m                  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mClear conversation history and free up context\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m/release-notes\u001b[39m          \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mView release notes\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m/rewind\u001b[39m          "]
